@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Inter, Segoe UI, Arial"

title Automated CI/CD & Weekly Upstream Contract Verification Pipeline

|Developer / Cron Trigger|
start
split
    :Git Push / Pull Request to `main`;
split again
    :Scheduled GitHub Action Cron\n(Every Monday @ 06:00 UTC);
end split

|GitHub Actions Runner (Stage 1: Static & Unit Verification)|
:Checkout Repository & Setup Python 3.12;
:Run **Ruff** Linter (`ruff check src/ tests/`);
if (Lint Passed?) then (no)
    :Fail Pipeline & Block Merge;<<#FFE6E6>>
    stop
else (yes)
endif
:Run **Pytest** Unit Suite against HTML Snapshots\n(`pytest --cov=src tests/`);
if (100% Schema Tests Passed?) then (no)
    :Fail Pipeline & Alert Developer;<<#FFE6E6>>
    stop
else (yes)
endif

|GitHub Actions Runner (Stage 2: Live Contract & Container Build)|
fork
    :Execute Live Contract Check against\n`mosqueprayertimes.com/alsalam-mtl`;
    :Verify `MPT={...}` Regex & 56/60-char String Slice;
    if (Upstream DOM/JS Drifted?) then (yes)
        :Trigger Contract Drift Alert\n(Fix Parser Before 72h Cache Expires);<<#FFF2CC>>
        stop
    else (no)
    endif
fork again
    :Build Multi-Stage Rootless Docker Image\n(`UID 10001`, `python:3.12-slim`);
    :Verify Image Build & Layer Integrity;
end fork

|Production Homelab (Proxmox LXC)|
:Ready for Production Pull & Deployment;<<#E6FFE6>>
stop
@enduml